Global instruction management

Usage: akm instructions <COMMAND>

Commands:
  sync              Distribute global instructions to tool directories
  scaffold-project  Create AGENTS.md + CLAUDE.md in project root
  edit              Edit global instructions in $EDITOR
  publish           Publish global instructions to personal registry
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
